            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Yaka yikwisa msogolomo, ŵanace ŵenu taciŵa ali mkumwusya jemanja kuti, ‘Ligongo cici AMBUJE Mlungu jwetu, ŵatulamwile kuti tugapikanileje malamusi ni majiganyo gosopega?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jemanja timcajanga jemanjajo kuti, ‘Uweji twaliji acikapolo ŵa Mwenye jwa ku Iguputo, nambo AMBUJE ŵatukulupwisye mwamacili gawo gamakulungwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uweji ni meso getu twaweni AMBUJE ali mkwatendela ŵandu ŵa ku Iguputo yindu yakusimonjesya ni yakogoya, kuti ŵape cilango jemanjajo, pamo ni mwenye jwawo ni maŵasa gawo gosope. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE Mlungu jwetujo, ŵatukopwesye uweji ku Iguputo, ni kutuyicisya mpaka akuno, ŵatupele cilambo acino mpela muŵatendele cilanga ni acinangolo ŵetu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni ligongo lyakwe AMBUJE Mlungu jwetujo ŵatulamwile uweji kuti, tugapikanileje malamusi gosopega ni kumcimbicisya jwalakwejo. Naga tukutenda yeleyi, jwalakwejo taciwusunga mtundu wetu, ni kutukamucisya kuti tuŵe ŵandu ŵakusicila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo yindu yakusosekwa sambano uweji kuyitenda, ni kuyisunga yosope yatulamwile AMBUJE Mlungu jwetu mwakulupicika, ni jwalakwejo taciŵa jwakusangalala ni uwejo.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
